# @last-edited: 2026-10-05 17:05 UTC+7.
# @title: .assetsignore — keep the Cloudflare upload identical to the Vercel upload.
# @state: mirrors .vercelignore; tests/landing-hosting.test.mjs fails on drift.
# @dependencies: none stated.

# WHY this file exists: Cloudflare Pages uploads the whole directory, where Vercel reads .vercelignore.
# Without it the two hosts publish different file sets, and the page that exists on one is a 404 on the other.
# Same exclusions, same order.

.vercel
.env*
AGENTS.md
.gitignore
.vercelignore
vercel.json
.assetsignore